-- | The on-ledger model for vehicle leasing.
--
-- Empty on purpose. Upstream's licensing contracts were removed with the rest of
-- its demo, and the leasing contracts have not been written yet — a car dealer
-- supplies a vehicle, a leasing company finances it, a customer leases it, and
-- none of that is modelled here so far. Who the parties are lives in the
-- backend's in-memory @PartyRegistry@, not on the ledger.
--
-- The package still exists because the build generates the backend's Java
-- bindings from this package's DAR: @LedgerApi@ and @Pqs@ need the @daml.Daml@
-- dictionary, and the token-standard bindings come from the data-dependencies in
-- @daml.yaml@. So this is the file to start adding templates to.
module Leasing.Lease where
